msgstr "要求书名与作者都精确匹配（默认：书名精确，作者取最相似）。"

#: src/novel_downloader/apps/cli/commands/batch.py:208
msgid "Write unmatched entries to PATH (default: logs/not_found_<site>.txt)."
msgstr "把未匹配的条目写入 PATH（默认 logs/not_found_<site>.txt）。"

#: src/novel_downloader/apps/cli/commands/batch.py:215
msgid ""
"Overwrite an existing --not-found file that was not written by this "
